      "text": "6. Very finely dice the garlic."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "7. Finely slice the stock cube."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "8. Pour hot water over the frozen peas, drain, then season with salt."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "9. Crack the eggs into a bowl, mix well, and add the cream. Season with salt and pepper."
    },
    {
